    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Butternut squash is&nbsp;a pear-shaped, creamy-tan winter squash with a long neck and a hard, edible skin that is often peeled. It has a sweet and nutty flavor, dense orange flesh, and a small seed cavity in the bulbous end, making it versatile for cooking. Its flesh becomes tender and creamy when roasted and is also good pureed for soups or used in baked goods.&nbsp;</span></p>",
